## Minimal Example Code Reproducing the Issue

```js
import Koa from 'koa';
const app = new Koa();
const bot = new Telegraf(token);

const webhook = await bot.createWebhook({ domain });
app.use((ctx, next) => {
  return webhook(ctx.request, ctx.response, next);
});
```

## Expected Behavior

200 status code

## Current Behavior

404 status code

